{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 11, "data": [{"docid2": 2253143, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260718_2253143.htm", "content": "　　7月17日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开市政府专题会议，研究推进生态环境保护和安全生产工作。市领导杨国昕、李盛烨、张元明、廖金辉、钟科、游文杰参加。\n　　陈岳峰强调，要深入学习贯彻习近平总书记关于树", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260718_2253143.htm", "docreltime": "2026.07.18 09:08:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2466695, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "研究推进生态环境保护和安全生产工作", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260718_2253143.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2248978, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260717_2248978.htm", "content": "　　7月16日，在收听收看全省安全生产隐患大排查大整治工作部署推进会后，市委、市政府随即召开视频会议，对全市安全生产工作进行再安排、再部署、再推进。市委书记李春出席会议并讲话，市长陈岳峰主持。市领导杨国昕", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260717_2248978.htm", "docreltime": "2026.07.17 11:33:00", "doctitle": "全市安全生产隐患大排查大整治工作部署推进会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2462494, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260717_2248978.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2233444, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260702_2233444.htm", "content": "　　7月1日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开市政府专题会议，研究推进省委巡视反馈意见整改，以及群众身边不正之风和腐败问题集中整治工作。市领导杨国昕、林菁、廖金辉、游文杰参加。\n　　陈岳峰强调，要深入学习贯", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260702_2233444.htm", "docreltime": "2026.07.02 08:22:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2446390, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "研究推进政府系统巡视整改和群腐整治工作", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260702_2233444.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2231841, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/t20260625_2231841.htm", "content": "　　6月24日，市委书记李春主持召开工作汇报会，听取第十八届省运会开闭幕式和第十二届省老健会开幕式筹备工作情况，研究部署下一步工作。市领导陈岳峰、郭海阳、张炜琳、廖丽青、林菁、游文杰、黄月珍参加。\n　　李", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/t20260625_2231841.htm", "docreltime": "2026.06.25 09:07:00", "doctitle": "省运会、省老健会开闭幕式筹备工作汇报会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2444510, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/t20260625_2231841.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2208777, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/t20260523_2208777.htm", "content": "　　5月22日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持召开市政府专题会议，研究推进民生热点问题专项整治工作。副市长廖金辉、游文杰参加。\n　　陈岳峰强调，要深入学习贯彻习近平总书记关于保障和改善民生的重要论述，扎实开展", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/t20260523_2208777.htm", "docreltime": "2026.05.23 09:15:00", "doctitle": "市政府召开专题会议研究推进民生热点问题专项整治工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2420267, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/t20260523_2208777.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202605/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2191537, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202602/t20260227_2191537.htm", "content": "　　2月26日，市委政法工作会议召开。会议深入学习贯彻中央、省委政法工作会议精神，研究部署今年全市政法工作。会前，市委书记李春作出批示。市委常委、政法委书记郑隆松出席并讲话，副市长、公安局局长游文杰主持。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202602/t20260227_2191537.htm", "docreltime": "2026.02.27 09:37:00", "doctitle": "市委政法工作会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2400232, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202602/t20260227_2191537.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202602/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2188543, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202602/t20260205_2188543.htm", "content": "\n　　2月4日，市委书记李春、市长陈岳峰代表市委、市政府，分别与11个县（市、区）签订2026年平安建设、生态环境保护目标责任书。市领导郑隆松、郭海阳、周庆裕、钟科、游文杰、张春华，市法院院长陈枫出席。\n　　会", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202602/t20260205_2188543.htm", "docreltime": "2026.02.05 08:50:00", "doctitle": "市委、市政府与各县（市、区）签订2026年平安建设、生态环境保护目标责任书", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2396839, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202602/t20260205_2188543.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202602/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2183162, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202601/t20260112_2183162.htm", "content": "\n　　   、\n　　 \n　　 　 　  \n　　1月10日，三明市公安局在市人民警察训练中心举行第六个中国人民警察节系列活动，局领导、高级警长、局属各单位负责人及荣休民警、获奖民警、家属代表共200余人欢聚一堂，共庆属于", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202601/t20260112_2183162.htm", "docreltime": "2026.01.11 23:42:00", "doctitle": "市公安局举行第六个中国人民警察节系列活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2390448, "sourcename": "三明市公安局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202601/t20260112_2183162.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202601/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2160182, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/t20251009_2160182.htm", "content": "\n　　10月8日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰前往市公安局、交通运输局、文旅局、应急局，检查值班值守工作，并看望慰问坚守岗位一线的干部职工。副市长钟科、游文杰分别参加。\n　　陈岳峰代表市委、市政府向大家的辛勤付出", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/t20251009_2160182.htm", "docreltime": "2025.10.09 08:51:00", "doctitle": "市领导检查值班值守工作并慰问一线值班人员", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2362966, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/t20251009_2160182.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202510/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2158450, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250926_2158450.htm", "content": "\n　　9月25日，市委副书记、市长陈岳峰以“四不两直”方式深入三元名成冷冻物流公司、三明南站枢纽工程、富鑫化工运输公司、三明交警铁骑中队、三明综合市场等地，开展节前安全和市场保供检查，看望慰问一线工作人员", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250926_2158450.htm", "docreltime": "2025.09.26 08:40:00", "doctitle": "市领导开展节前检查看望活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2361059, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250926_2158450.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2143311, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "相关活动报道", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250801_2143311.htm", "content": "\n　　7月30日至31日，全市政法领导干部“深入贯彻中央八项规定精神，着力提升履职能力水平”专题研讨班举办。市委常委、政法委书记郑隆松出席开班式并讲话。副市长、公安局局长游文杰主持，市法院院长陈枫、市检察院", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250801_2143311.htm", "docreltime": "2025.08.01 08:14:00", "doctitle": "全市政法领导干部专题研讨班举办", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2342941, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250801_2143311.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/", "rels": []}]}